.pytest_cache/
__pycache__/
# cache/ and output/ from the real Phase 2 run (2026-11-24) ARE committed
# deliberately, for full offline reproducibility -- see
# HISTORICAL_DATA_MANIFEST.md. A future, different reconstruction run's
# scratch output should NOT be committed; re-add an ignore rule then.
#
# data/ is a read-only IMPORTED copy of Codex's external export (originals
# at the path in EXECUTIVE_SUMMARY.md / HISTORICAL_DATA_MANIFEST.md, with
# every file's SHA-256 already recorded there and in EVIDENCE_MANIFEST.md)
# -- not duplicated into git history, 86MB of it is one raw CSV. Re-import
# with the same commands used originally if this workspace needs it again.
data/

# input/ is the same pattern for Phase 3's Phase-2B supplementary import --
# 591MB, one raw CSV is 619MB of that. Hashes recorded in
# PHASE3_BASELINE_RECONCILIATION.md; re-import from the external audit
# directory named there if this workspace needs it again.
input/
